  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCHA/UNDP Connecting Business initiative (CBi)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Connecting Business initiative (CBi) strategically engages the private sector before, during, and after emergencies, increasing the scale and effectiveness of humanitarian response and early recovery in a coordinated manner. Jointly managed by the United Nations Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs (OCHA) and the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP), CBi supports crisis response and development efforts by integrating and engaging the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
